        "app_name": "Meta Horizon Worlds",
        "release_date": "1980-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
        "description": "# Explore tons of crazy, fun, unique worlds and live events with your friends in Meta Horizon Worlds. \n\nJump into games, sports, music, and more through your headset, smartphone, or laptop. Even if you’re far apart, it’s fun and easy to feel like you’re really together with friends in your own world. \n\nStart a crazy battle in Super Rumble, then jump to see some of your favorite artists in concert. Laugh nonstop from the front row at Soapstone Comedy. Never-before-seen worlds and live events launch all the time. Compete in quests. Own leaderboards. Earn rewards. The more you discover the easier it is to learn skills, meet friends along the way, and find new ways of having fun. Talk, hang, and move from world to world in a group. \n\nEvery part of you is welcome in Meta Horizon Worlds. Celebrate the fun and fantastical side of you to go to a live event or your fandom with colors and gear from your favorite teams. Win quests for tokens that you can use to unlock exclusive wearables and emotes.  Get rewarded for being yourself and so much more.\n\nMeta Horizon Worlds includes supervision for parent-managed account users 10-12 years old (age may vary by region) and optional supervision features for 13-17 year olds (age may vary by region). It is currently available on Meta Quest, mobile and desktop. You can also manage and set up your profile from the Meta Horizon mobile app. Everyone in Meta Horizon Worlds must abide by our Code of Conduct for Virtual Experiences. ",
